fireworks-tech-graph-dsh
========================

This project adapts the upstream Agent Skill **fireworks-tech-graph**
(https://github.com/yizhiyanhua-ai/fireworks-tech-graph), which is distributed
under the MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025 fireworks-tech-graph contributors.

The upstream skill source is re-vendored (copied) under `skills/fireworks-tech-graph/`
so this plugin is self-contained and installable without network access to the
upstream at install time. The upstream MIT LICENSE is preserved verbatim in the
root `LICENSE` file and inside `skills/fireworks-tech-graph/LICENSE`.

The DeepSeek Harness adapter code in this repository — namely:
  - lib/index.js
  - dsh.plugin.json
  - cordis.patch.yml
  - this package's root package.json and README.md
is original work released under the MIT License as well.

Upstream tracking: a scheduled GitHub Action (see .github/workflows/sync-upstream.yml)
and the `sync_upstream.sh` script refresh `skills/fireworks-tech-graph/` from the
upstream `main` branch automatically.

Attribution summary:
